    "quote": "Manufacturers must report any thermal event involving fire, smoke, injury, evacuation, or emergency-service response to the relevant regulator within 5 calendar days of learning of it, and provide a complete incident report within 30 days. Customers whose unit is affected by a confirmed safety issue must be notified directly within 5 days of confirmation, with immediate instructions where continued use may pose a serious risk."
