    "quote": "The maximum permitted failure rate is 7% per model. Manufacturers must provide full per-model results, including sample size and failure rate, confidentially to the relevant regulator; these results are not subject to public or customer disclosure. A model exceeding the limit must undergo corrective action and a passing retest within a regulator-set period; regulators may restrict sales where the risk warrants it."
   },
